### ===========================================
### PROTECTED ENDPOINTS (cần x-api-key + Bearer token)
### ===========================================

### Example: Logout (với full authentication)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Example: Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Example: Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Example: Update User Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
	"fullName": "Updated User"
}

### ===========================================
### NOTES
### ===========================================
# 1. @apiKey = x-api-key header value từ .env (INTERNAL_API_KEY)
# 2. @token = Bearer token (JWT) - lấy từ login response
# 3. Thiếu hoặc sai headers → 401 Unauthorized
# 4. Thay @token bằng token thực từ sign-in response
# 5. AUTH_REQUIRED=false trong .env để disable authentication
